	(text "ESTOP: VIN from the safety relay contact (or a dry contact to VIN OUT) = run.\nESTOP_IN low while the chain is closed: a broken wire reads as a stop.\n2 x 4.7 k series and 1 k shunt: off below 5 V, on from 9.5 V (12 V supply);\non a 24 V supply, IEC 61131-2 type 3. 0.15 W per resistor at 30 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58.42 104.14 0)
		(effects
