	(text "Watchdog: the firmware toggles WDI every 0.5 s or less (timeout 0.9-2.5 s); WDI left floating\n(pin not configured: reset, bootloader, debug) disables it. On a timeout it resets the MCU\nfor 200 ms: every output pin goes high impedance and its pull resistor turns the output off.\nIt also holds the reset while +3V3 is below 2.93 V. RESET LED: any reset (watchdog, debugger)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f97fe35-a343-59e7-b018-e6ce37663714")
	)
	(text "CHASSIS: shields of the RJ45 and of the Modbus cable. Functional earth on pin 3 (FE) of the supply\nterminal block J1; 1 nF 2 kV to 0 V at each connector row (C37 at the EtherCAT ports)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "794a3a6f-15be-5e46-92ce-c480970f5895")
	)
